#. settings-schema.json->kopf-speedtest->description
msgid "Internet speed test"
msgstr ""

#. settings-schema.json->hinweis-speedtest->description
msgid ""
"Right-click the panel icon to open the menu with “Run a speed test now”."
msgstr ""

#. settings-schema.json->speedtest-programm->description
msgid "Speed test program"
msgstr ""

#. settings-schema.json->speedtest-programm->tooltip
msgid ""
"What measures. “Automatic” picks the best program present. A program you "
"selected that later goes missing shows up as “Not found”; measuring falls "
"back to automatic, and your choice applies again once the program is back."
msgstr ""

#. settings-schema.json->hinweis-speedtest-programm->description
msgid ""
"aVincePulse can measure with librespeed-cli or with speedtest-cli. "
"“Automatic” takes librespeed-cli where present: it measures against the free"
" LibreSpeed servers and is the only one of the two that reports jitter. With"
" speedtest-cli the jitter row therefore stays at “--”. Only what is "
"installed on this machine is offered."
msgstr ""

#. settings-schema.json->hinweis-kein-speedtest->description
msgid ""
"The internet speed test needs either librespeed-cli or speedtest-cli. "
"Neither was found on this machine, so the SPEED, PING, JITTER and LAST rows "
"stay at “--”. Every other value is unaffected."
msgstr ""

